NPC-002: Ah! You found your way back, hunter. I would say you look like shit if not for. Well.
Devin: Yes, you may stop gesturing. Your quips are as amusing as ever.
NPC-002: Heading to your room?
Devin: Yes. Only that —
NPC-002: You’re still here.
Devin: I need reminding of mine room number.
NPC-002: Left your memory in that old crypt again with your gin?
Devin: You do so enjoy this form of torture.
NPC-002: Only the finest treatment for our esteemed guest of honour. Anyway. What of a remedy to soothe whatever it is that troubles you? On this house, of course. What will it be hunter?
Devin: Room. Please.
NPC-002: Seven, of course. Second floor.
Devin: Tis appreciated. I’ll return for that remedy later.
NPC-002: I am sure you will.
